<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia's SBIs auction results.</title>
<headline>Indonesia's SBIs auction results.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is the result of central bank papers (SBIs) auction on Wednesday at 0500 GMT:</p>
<p>    SBIs			     28-day</p>
<p>Total (in billion rupiah)  450.0</p>
